{"words": [{"text": "فَإِن", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "لَّمْ", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "تَفْعَلُوا۟", "translation": "you do"}, {"text": "فَأْذَنُوا۟", "translation": "then be informed"}, {"text": "بِحَرْبٍۢ", "translation": "of a war"}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَرَسُولِهِۦ ۖ", "translation": "and His Messenger"}, {"text": "وَإِن", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "تُبْتُمْ", "translation": "you repent"}, {"text": "فَلَكُمْ", "translation": "then for you"}, {"text": "رُءُوسُ", "translation": "(is)"}, {"text": "أَمْوَٰلِكُمْ", "translation": "your capital "}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(do) not"}, {"text": "تَظْلِمُونَ", "translation": "wrong"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "تُظْلَمُونَ", "translation": "you will be wronged"}], "sahih": "And if you do not, then be informed of a war [against you] from Allāh and His Messenger. But if you repent, you may have your principal - [thus] you do no wrong, nor are you wronged."}